  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering local communities  of Rishing Rural Municiplaity for Long-Term Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is designed to strengthen women&#x2019;s economic empowerment and sustainable livelihoods for marginalized households in Ramjakot and Pipaltar, Ward No. 5 of Rishing Rural Municipality, Tanahu District. It adopts integrated approaches to promote resilient livelihoods, inclusive economic growth, and strengthened community leadership.  The project is designed to address these gaps by promoting sustainable and climate-smart farming practices, strengthening market linkages, and enhancing financial inclusion through savings and credit mechanisms. These integrated interventions aim to build resilient livelihoods, reduce poverty, and support inclusive rural development.</narrative>
  </description>
